WEBVTT

00:00:00.469 --> 00:00:05.165
Welcome to Alaventra. Rank in
search. Get recommended by AI.

00:00:06.143 --> 00:00:10.493
In tutorial 3.1, you'll keep
your business details up to date,

00:00:10.543 --> 00:00:13.207
so every new page and report uses them.

00:00:14.237 --> 00:00:17.412
First, open Website
settings in the sidebar.

00:00:17.462 --> 00:00:19.787
Business details is the first tab.

00:00:19.837 --> 00:00:22.646
The other tabs hold the rest
of your website's settings.

00:00:23.630 --> 00:00:26.580
Your main country is where
your customers search.

00:00:26.630 --> 00:00:29.439
What you do sums up your
business in a sentence or two.

00:00:31.180 --> 00:00:33.505
Next, add a service
under What do you sell.

00:00:33.555 --> 00:00:36.449
Type it, press Enter,
and it joins your list.

00:00:39.130 --> 00:00:43.180
Then describe who your customers are,
pick the main goal of your website,

00:00:43.230 --> 00:00:45.655
and choose how your pages should sound.

00:00:45.705 --> 00:00:48.694
Your call to action is what
a reader should do next.

00:00:49.688 --> 00:00:52.788
Business facts are the real
facts your pages may quote,

00:00:52.838 --> 00:00:57.288
like years in business or
certifications. Not sure what counts?

00:00:57.338 --> 00:00:58.932
Click What makes a good fact?

00:00:59.941 --> 00:01:05.251
Now keep up to three competitors here.
Remove one with its cross, and type another.

00:01:05.301 --> 00:01:08.359
Brand names are the names
people use for your company.

00:01:09.912 --> 00:01:12.161
When you're done, click Save changes.

00:01:14.937 --> 00:01:16.887
From then on, every new page,

00:01:16.937 --> 00:01:20.987
report and AI visibility question
starts from your details.

00:01:21.037 --> 00:01:24.992
The Write a page form already uses
your call to action and facts.

00:01:26.001 --> 00:01:29.176
So, open Business details,
add what you sell,

00:01:29.226 --> 00:01:33.176
describe your customers and your
call to action, add your facts,

00:01:33.226 --> 00:01:36.577
update competitors and brand
names, and save changes.

00:01:37.571 --> 00:01:40.671
Your business details
are up to date. Next,

00:01:40.721 --> 00:01:44.895
add the author and reviewer
behind your pages in tutorial 3.2.
